+  </aside>
+  <div class="workspace">
+    <header class="topbar"><div class="breadcrumb">工程手册<span>/</span>协作规范<span>/</span><strong>Git</strong></div><button class="print-button" type="button" onclick="window.print()"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 7V2.5h10V7M5 14H3V7h14v7h-2M5 11h10v6H5z"/><path d="M14 9h1"/></svg>打印文档</button></header>
+    <div class="page-layout">
+      <main id="main">
+        <section class="hero" id="overview" aria-labelledby="page-title">
+          <div class="eyebrow"><span></span>团队协作规范 <span class="eyebrow-divider">/</span> WORKFLOW</div>
+          <h1 id="page-title">Git 使用规范<span class="title-dot">.</span></h1>
+          <p class="hero-description measure-prose">把约定写下来，把精力留给创造。<br>统一分支、提交与评审方式，让每一次变更都清晰、可追溯。</p>
+          <div class="meta"><span><span class="meta-icon" aria-hidden="true">◎</span>适用范围：团队所有代码仓库</span><span><span class="meta-icon" aria-hidden="true">◷</span>阅读约 6 分钟</span></div>
+          <div class="principle"><span class="principle-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><div><strong>一个任务，一个分支，一次有意义的合并。</strong><p>主分支始终保持可发布；所有变更通过 Pull Request（PR）评审后合入。</p></div></div>
+        </section>
+
+        <section class="doc-section" id="branches" aria-labelledby="branches-title">
+          <div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number">01</span><h2 id="branches-title">分支命名</h2><span class="heading-caption">BRANCH NAMING</span></div>
+          <p class="measure-prose">从最新的 <code>main</code> 创建工作分支，使用小写英文与连字符。名称应说明变更目的，并关联任务编号，方便检索与追踪。</p>
+          <div class="code-block syntax"><div><span class="code-label">命名格式</span><code><span class="code-accent">&lt;type&gt;</span>/&lt;issue-id&gt;-&lt;short-description&gt;</code></div><button class="copy-button" type="button" data-copy="feat/128-user-login" aria-label="复制分支命名示例">复制示例 <span aria-hidden="true">⧉</span></button></div>
+          <div class="table-wrap"><table><caption class="sr-only">分支类型、使用场景和命名示例</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">分支类型</th><th scope="col">使用场景</th><th scope="col">命名示例</th></tr></thead><tbody>
+            <tr><td><code class="type-pill">feat</code></td><td>新增功能</td><td><code>feat/128-user-login</code></td></tr>
+            <tr><td><code class="type-pill">fix</code></td><td>修复缺陷</td><td><code>fix/256-token-expiry</code></td></tr>
+            <tr><td><code class="type-pill">refactor</code></td><td>重构现有实现</td><td><code>refactor/312-auth-service</code></td></tr>
+            <tr><td><code class="type-pill">docs</code></td><td>更新文档</td><td><code>docs/108-api-guide</code></td></tr>
+            <tr><td><code class="type-pill">chore</code></td><td>构建、依赖与维护</td><td><code>chore/420-update-lint</code></td></tr>
+          </tbody></table></div>
+          <div class="inline-note"><span aria-hidden="true">ⓘ</span><p><strong>主分支保护</strong>：禁止直接推送或强制推送到 <code>main</code>。分支保持短期存活，合并完成后删除；没有任务编号时可省略编号。</p></div>
+          <details><summary>从一个干净的分支开始 <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><div class="detail-content"><p>确认工作区干净，再更新主分支并创建工作分支。</p><pre><code>git switch main
+git pull --ff-only origin main
+git switch -c feat/128-user-login</code></pre></div></details>
+        </section>
+
+        <section class="doc-section" id="commits" aria-labelledby="commits-title">
