+          <p class="measure-prose">一次提交只做一件事。使用统一的提交格式，让历史记录能直接回答“改了什么”，必要时在正文解释“为什么”。</p>
+          <div class="code-block syntax"><div><span class="code-label">提交格式 · scope 可选</span><code><span class="code-accent">&lt;type&gt;</span>(&lt;scope&gt;): &lt;description&gt;</code></div></div>
+          <div class="commit-example"><div class="example-header"><span><span class="example-dot"></span>一个清晰的提交</span><button type="button" class="copy-button" data-copy="feat(auth): 支持邮箱验证码登录&#10;&#10;为未设置密码的用户提供登录入口。&#10;新增验证码有效期与重试次数校验。&#10;&#10;Refs: #128">复制 <span aria-hidden="true">⧉</span></button></div><pre><code><span class="code-accent">feat</span>(auth): 支持邮箱验证码登录
+
+为未设置密码的用户提供登录入口。
+新增验证码有效期与重试次数校验。
+
+<span class="code-muted">Refs: #128</span></code></pre></div>
+          <div class="two-columns"><div><h3>写清楚变更</h3><ul class="plain-list"><li>类型沿用分支类型，测试使用 <code>test</code>，性能优化使用 <code>perf</code>。</li><li>描述以动作开头，如“修复”“新增”“移除”；标题建议控制在 72 字符内。</li><li>有不兼容变更时，在类型或作用域后加 <code>!</code>，并在正文说明迁移方式。</li></ul></div><div class="avoid-box"><h3><span aria-hidden="true">↘</span> 避免含糊的提交</h3><p><code>update</code><code>fix bug</code><code>修改一下</code></p><div class="avoid-divider"></div><p class="better-example">更好的写法</p><code>fix(auth): 修复令牌过期后无法退出的问题</code></div></div>
+        </section>
+
+        <section class="doc-section" id="review" aria-labelledby="review-title">
+          <div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number">03</span><h2 id="review-title">代码评审</h2><span class="heading-caption">CODE REVIEW</span></div>
+          <p class="measure-prose">作者对变更质量负责，评审者对合并质量把关。尽量让每个 PR 聚焦单一目标；大改动先拆分，或提前对齐设计。</p>
+          <ol class="workflow">
+            <li><span class="step-number">1</span><div><h3>先自查，再发起 PR <span class="role">作者</span></h3><p>检查差异，移除调试代码与敏感信息，运行相关测试。未准备好评审时，使用 Draft PR。</p></div></li>
+            <li><span class="step-number">2</span><div><h3>交代背景与验证方式 <span class="role">作者</span></h3><p>标题沿用提交格式；描述包含变更原因、主要改动、关联任务、测试结果与风险。界面变更附前后截图，必要时补充回滚方案。</p></div></li>
+            <li><span class="step-number">3</span><div><h3>邀请评审，逐项回应 <span class="role">作者 + 评审者</span></h3><p>至少邀请一位熟悉模块的同事，建议在一个工作日内首次响应。优先检查正确性、边界条件、可维护性与测试；明确区分必须修改的问题和可选建议。</p></div></li>
+            <li><span class="step-number">4</span><div><h3>通过检查后合并 <span class="role">合并负责人</span></h3><p>获得至少一位非作者的批准，所有必需 CI 检查通过，阻塞问题解决后，使用 Squash merge 合入。核对最终提交信息，删除工作分支。</p></div></li>
+          </ol>
+          <div class="review-note"><strong>评审后又有修改？</strong><p>推送修复后说明改动，并重新请求评审。新增实质性变更需要重新批准；发生冲突时，由作者解决并重新运行检查。</p></div>
+        </section>
+
+        <section class="doc-section" id="checklist" aria-labelledby="checklist-title">
+          <div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number">04</span><h2 id="checklist-title">合并前，再确认一次</h2></div>
+          <div class="checklist-header"><p>准备好把这次变更交给团队了吗？</p><output id="progress" aria-live="polite">0 / 5 已完成</output></div>
+          <div class="checklist">
+            <label><input type="checkbox"><span>分支命名和 PR 标题符合约定</span></label>
+            <label><input type="checkbox"><span>变更范围清晰，描述包含验证结果与关联任务</span></label>
+            <label><input type="checkbox"><span>相关测试与所有必需 CI 检查通过</span></label>
+            <label><input type="checkbox"><span>至少一位非作者批准，所有阻塞意见已解决</span></label>
+            <label><input type="checkbox"><span>最终提交信息准确，发布风险与回滚方式已明确</span></label>
+          </div>
+          <p class="checklist-hint">清单仅辅助本次自查，不替代仓库中的审批与自动检查。</p>
+        </section>
+        <footer class="page-footer"><span>让每一次提交，都成为可靠的协作记录。</span><a href="#overview">回到顶部 <span aria-hidden="true">↑</span></a></footer>
+      </main>
+      <aside class="page-toc" aria-label="本页目录"><div class="toc-title">本页内容</div><a href="#branches">分支命名</a><a href="#commits">提交信息</a><a href="#review">代码评审</a><a href="#checklist">合并检查清单</a><div class="toc-note"><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><strong>小步提交<br>及时评审<br>持续交付</strong><p>简单的约定，<br>长期的默契。</p></div></aside>
+    </div>
+  </div>
+  <div class="sr-only" id="copy-status" role="status"></div>
+  <script>
+    const copyStatus = document.getElementById('copy-status');
+    document.querySelectorAll('[data-copy]').forEach(button => {
+      button.addEventListener('click', async () => {
+        const value = button.dataset.copy;
+        try {
+          if (navigator.clipboard && window.isSecureContext) await navigator.clipboard.writeText(value);
+          else {
+            const field = document.createElement('textarea');
+            field.value = value; field.style.position = 'fixed'; field.style.opacity = '0';
+            document.body.appendChild(field); field.select();
+            const success = document.execCommand('copy'); field.remove(); button.focus();
+            if (!success) throw new Error('copy unavailable');
+          }
+          const original = button.innerHTML;
+          button.textContent = '已复制 ✓'; button.disabled = true;
+          copyStatus.textContent = '示例已复制到剪贴板';
+          setTimeout(() => { button.innerHTML = original; button.disabled = false; }, 1800);
+        } catch { copyStatus.textContent = '复制失败，请选中示例手动复制。'; button.textContent = '请手动复制'; }
+      });
+    });
+    const checks = [...document.querySelectorAll('.checklist input')];
+    checks.forEach(input => input.addEventListener('change', () => {
+      const count = checks.filter(item => item.checked).length;
+      document.getElementById('progress').textContent = `${count} / 5 已完成`;
+    }));
+    const links = [...document.querySelectorAll('.section-nav a')];
+    if ('IntersectionObserver' in window) {
+      const observer = new IntersectionObserver(entries => {
+        entries.forEach(entry => {
+          if (!entry.isIntersecting) return;
+          links.forEach(link => {
+            const active = link.hash === '#' + entry.target.id;
+            link.classList.toggle('active', active);
+            if (active) link.setAttribute('aria-current', 'location'); else link.removeAttribute('aria-current');
+          });
+        });
+      }, { rootMargin: '-10% 0px -65% 0px', threshold: 0 });
+      document.querySelectorAll('main section').forEach(section => observer.observe(section));
+    }
+  </script>
+</body>
+</html>
diff --git a/style.css b/style.css
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..43ffe22d9ba579a4e4284e30209cf4ec0eafae84
--- /dev/null
+++ b/style.css
@@ -0,0 +1,103 @@
+@layer measure;
+:root{color-scheme:light;--paper:#fffefa;--sidebar:#f7f6f2;--ink:#292c28;--muted:#7d8179;--line:#e6e7df;--accent:#c66a3e;--accent-soft:#f4e9df;--green:#5c7465}
+*{box-sizing:border-box}
+html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:100px}
+body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:system-ui,"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;font-size:15px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
+button,input{font:inherit}
+a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
+button,a,input,summary{-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
+button{cursor:pointer}
+button:focus-visible,a:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:5px}
+p{margin:0 0 18px;color:#62665e}
+svg{display:block;width:20px;height:20px}
+.sidebar{position:fixed;inset:0 auto 0 0;width:248px;background:var(--sidebar);border-right:1px solid var(--line);padding:35px 23px 22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;z-index:3}
+.brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;font-size:17px;font-weight:650;white-space:nowrap}
+.brand-mark{background:var(--accent);border-radius:9px;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;width:37px;height:40px;flex-shrink:0}
+.brand-mark svg{width:26px;height:26px}
+.brand small{display:block;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1.2px;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted);margin-top:7px}
+.nav-label{font-size:12px;color:#95988f;margin:49px 12px 18px;letter-spacing:1px}
+.document-label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;padding:0 10px;margin-bottom:15px}
+.document-label svg{width:17px;height:17px;color:#6c7066}
+.live-dot{margin-left:auto;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green)}
+.section-nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}
+.section-nav a{padding:10px 13px;border-radius:5px;font-size:14px;color:#777b72;position:relative}
+.section-nav a span{font-size:11px;display:inline-block;width:29px;color:#9a9d95;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
+.section-nav a:hover{background:#edede6}
+.section-nav a.active{background:#eee5da;color:#9d552f;font-weight:600}
+.section-nav a.active:before{content:"";height:16px;width:3px;position:absolute;left:0;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);background:var(--accent);border-radius:2px}
+.section-nav a.active span{color:#b17a58}
+.sidebar-note{margin:auto 12px 35px;padding-top:55px}
+.note-icon{font-size:29px;color:#b9b9a9;display:block;margin-bottom:8px}
+.sidebar-note p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:#72766b;margin-bottom:10px}
+.sidebar-note>span:last-child{font-size:12px;color:#9b9e94}
+.sidebar-footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:20px 9px 0;font-size:11px;color:#8c9085}
+.version{font-size:10px;border:1px solid #dadcd2;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 5px}
+.footer-dot{width:5px;height:5px;background:#a6b59c;border-radius:50%;margin-left:auto}
+.workspace{margin-left:248px}
+.topbar{height:73px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:0 52px;background:var(--paper)}
+.breadcrumb{font-size:12px;color:#8c8e86;display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center}
+.breadcrumb span{color:#c2c4ba}.breadcrumb strong{font-weight:500;color:#54594f}
+.print-button{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;color:#6b7166;font-size:12px;background:transparent;border:0;padding:8px 0}
+.print-button svg{width:15px;height:15px}.print-button:hover{color:var(--accent)}
+.page-layout{max-width:1190px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,800px) 145px;gap:64px;padding:54px 52px 0}
+main{min-width:0}
+.eyebrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.4px;color:#8b8c80;margin-bottom:18px}
+.eyebrow>span:first-child{width:6px;height:6px;background:var(--accent);border-radius:50%}.eyebrow-divider{color:#c9c8bd;margin:0 3px}
+h1{font-size:44px;font-weight:650;margin:0 0 22px;letter-spacing:1px}
+.title-dot{color:var(--accent);margin-left:3px}
+.hero-description{font-size:16px;line-height:1.9;color:#7a7d73;margin-bottom:24px}
+.meta{display:flex;gap:26px;font-size:11px;color:#8e9187;flex-wrap:wrap}
+.meta-icon{font-size:15px;margin-right:6px;color:#919786}
+.principle{margin-top:33px;background:#f3f3e9;border:1px solid #e9e9da;border-radius:6px;padding:19px 20px;display:flex;gap:14px}
+.principle-symbol{font-size:23px;color:#7a8466;line-height:1.3}
+.principle strong{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#566049}
+.principle p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.75;margin:6px 0 0;color:#7b806d}
+.doc-section{padding-top:42px;margin-top:1px}
+.section-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:20px}
+.section-number{color:var(--accent);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;font-weight:600}
+h2{font-size:24px;font-weight:600;margin:0}
+.heading-caption{margin-left:auto;color:#a1a397;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1.3px;white-space:nowrap}
+.doc-section>p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;margin-bottom:20px}
+code,pre{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:12px;font-weight:400}
+p code,li code{background:#efefe7;border-radius:3px;padding:2px 5px;color:#565c50}
+.code-block{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;background:#f7f7f1;padding:15px 18px}
+.syntax{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-bottom:21px}
+.code-label{display:block;font-size:11px;color:#929588;margin-bottom:8px}
+.syntax code{font-size:12px;color:#555e50;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.code-accent{color:var(--accent)}
+.copy-button{border:0;background:none;padding:5px 0;color:#8a8e81;font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap}.copy-button:hover{color:var(--accent)}.copy-button span{margin-left:8px;font-size:15px}
+.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto}
+table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:13px;text-align:left}
+th{font-weight:500;color:#8c9083;font-size:11px;background:#f7f7f1;padding:11px 15px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
+td{padding:13px 15px;border-bottom:1px solid #edeee6;color:#73786b}
+td:first-child{width:22%}td:nth-child(2){width:30%}td code{white-space:nowrap;color:#686e60;font-size:11px}
+.type-pill{display:inline-block;border:1px solid #e4e7dc;background:#f1f3eb;color:#647453;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px}
+.inline-note{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:9px;margin:18px 0 22px;color:#989e8c}.inline-note>span{font-size:15px;margin-top:1px}
+.inline-note p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;margin:0;color:#8a8f81}.inline-note strong{font-weight:500;color:#717a65}
+details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:20px}
+summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px;color:#767e6b;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
+summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}summary>span{font-size:19px}details[open] summary>span{transform:rotate(45deg)}
+.detail-content{padding-top:18px}.detail-content p{font-size:13px}.detail-content pre{padding:16px;background:#f4f4ed;border-radius:5px;margin:0}
+pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;line-height:1.9;margin:0}
+.commit-example{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:25px;background:#fafaf5}
+.example-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#f3f4ed;padding:8px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);color:#868c7d;font-size:11px}
+.example-dot{display:inline-block;height:5px;width:5px;background:#8a9c78;border-radius:50%;margin-right:7px}
+.commit-example pre{padding:20px;color:#626c59}.code-muted{color:#929b88}
+.two-columns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:30px;padding-bottom:29px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
+h3{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 12px;color:#545d4d}
+.plain-list{padding-left:17px;margin:0}.plain-list li{font-size:13px;color:#7c8274;line-height:1.85;margin-bottom:8px}.plain-list li:last-child{margin-bottom:0}.plain-list li::marker{color:#b3b8a9}
+.avoid-box{background:#f8f3ed;padding:18px 20px;border-radius:5px}.avoid-box h3{font-size:13px;color:#8a745d}.avoid-box h3 span{margin-right:5px}.avoid-box p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.avoid-box p code{display:inline-block;margin:0 5px 5px 0;color:#9a8773;background:#f0e8dd;font-size:11px}.avoid-divider{border-top:1px solid #e9e0d5;margin:13px 0}.avoid-box .better-example{font-size:11px;color:#a38c76;margin-bottom:5px}.avoid-box>code{font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;color:#7d6a56;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
+.workflow{list-style:none;padding:2px 0 0;margin:25px 0 0}.workflow li{display:flex;gap:20px;position:relative;padding-bottom:27px}.workflow li:before{content:"";position:absolute;top:29px;left:14px;bottom:0;border-left:1px solid #dde2d2}.workflow li:last-child:before{display:none}.step-number{border:1px solid #dde2d2;background:#f3f5ec;color:#748665;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;width:29px;height:29px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;flex-shrink:0}.workflow h3{margin-top:3px;margin-bottom:9px;font-size:15px}.role{font-size:10px;font-weight:400;color:#999f90;margin-left:10px}.workflow p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;margin:0;max-width:36em}
+.review-note{border-left:2px solid #c7ad8e;padding:2px 0 2px 17px;margin:0 0 0 49px}.review-note strong{font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:#8a755d}.review-note p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;margin:7px 0 0;color:#8d8c7c}
+#checklist{margin-top:36px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
+.checklist-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:15px;margin-bottom:18px}.checklist-header p{font-size:13px;margin:0;color:#8a8f80}.checklist-header output{font-size:11px;color:#8a947b;white-space:nowrap}
+.checklist{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;background:#fafbf5;overflow:hidden}.checklist label{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13px;color:#747d68;padding:15px 18px;cursor:pointer;line-height:1.8}.checklist label+label{border-top:1px solid #e9ecdf}.checklist input{accent-color:#6f835b;width:16px;height:16px;flex-shrink:0;margin:3px 0 0;cursor:pointer}.checklist label:has(input:checked){background:#f0f3e8}.checklist input:checked+span{color:#9ba38e;text-decoration:line-through}.doc-section>.checklist-hint{font-size:11px;color:#a0a595;margin:12px 0 0;line-height:1.8}
+.page-footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:25px 0 30px;margin-top:44px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;font-size:11px;color:#a1a596}.page-footer a{color:#7e886f;white-space:nowrap}.page-footer a span{margin-left:9px}
+.page-toc{position:sticky;top:40px;align-self:start;padding-top:7px}.toc-title{font-size:11px;color:#737a69;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:17px}.page-toc>a{display:block;font-size:12px;color:#929887;border-left:1px solid var(--line);padding:7px 0 7px 14px}.page-toc>a:hover{color:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent)}
+.toc-note{margin-top:42px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:24px}.toc-note>span{font-size:23px;color:#bbbea9;display:block;margin-bottom:11px}.toc-note strong{font-size:17px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#858d77}.toc-note p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.9;color:#a4aa98;margin:13px 0 0}
+.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}.skip-link{position:fixed;left:270px;top:-70px;padding:10px;background:var(--paper);z-index:10}.skip-link:focus{top:10px}
+@media(min-width:1550px){.page-layout{padding-top:64px;gap:70px}.topbar{padding-left:max(52px,calc((100vw - 1190px - 248px)/2 + 52px))}}
+@media(max-width:1200px){.page-layout{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);max-width:900px;padding:45px 45px 0}.page-toc{display:none}.topbar{padding:0 45px}.sidebar{width:225px;padding-left:18px;padding-right:18px}.workspace{margin-left:225px}.brand{font-size:16px}.brand small{font-size:8px}}
+@media(max-width:800px){.sidebar{width:190px;padding:28px 12px 20px}.workspace{margin-left:190px}.brand{gap:8px;font-size:14px}.brand-mark{width:30px;height:34px}.brand small{font-size:7px;letter-spacing:.7px}.page-layout{padding:35px 28px 0}.topbar{padding:0 28px}.heading-caption{display:none}h1{font-size:36px}.meta{gap:10px}.two-columns{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:22px}.syntax{align-items:flex-start}.syntax code{font-size:11px}.copy-button{font-size:10px}.breadcrumb{gap:10px}}
+@media(max-width:600px){html{scroll-padding-top:28px}.sidebar{position:relative;width:100%;padding:20px 20px 0;border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.brand{font-size:16px}.brand small{font-size:8px}.nav-label,.document-label,.sidebar-note,.sidebar-footer{display:none}.section-nav{flex-direction:row;overflow-x:auto;margin-top:20px;gap:4px;padding-bottom:11px}.section-nav a{flex-shrink:0;font-size:12px;padding:8px 10px}.section-nav a span{display:none}.section-nav a.active:before{display:none}.workspace{margin-left:0}.topbar{height:54px;padding:0 22px}.breadcrumb{font-size:11px;gap:9px}.page-layout{padding:31px 22px 0}h1{font-size:36px;letter-spacing:0}.hero-description{font-size:15px}.eyebrow{font-size:10px}.meta{font-size:10px;gap:12px}.principle{padding:17px 14px;gap:10px;margin-top:26px}.principle strong{font-size:13px}.principle p{font-size:12px}.doc-section{padding-top:34px}h2{font-size:22px}.section-heading{gap:10px}.syntax{padding:14px 12px;gap:6px}.syntax code{font-size:10px}.code-label{font-size:10px}th,td{padding:12px 10px}td{font-size:12px}td code{font-size:10px}.workflow li{gap:14px}.workflow h3{font-size:14px}.role{display:block;margin:6px 0 0;font-size:10px}.review-note{margin-left:43px}.checklist-header{align-items:flex-start}.checklist-header p{font-size:12px}.checklist label{padding:14px;font-size:13px}.page-footer{font-size:10px;gap:12px}.skip-link{left:20px}}
+@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}}
+@media print{.sidebar,.topbar,.page-toc,.copy-button,.page-footer a,.skip-link{display:none}.workspace{margin:0}.page-layout{display:block;padding:0;max-width:none}body{background:white;color:black;font-size:12pt}.hero{padding-top:10px}.doc-section{break-inside:auto;padding-top:24px}h2,h3,.section-heading{break-after:avoid}tr,.principle,.workflow li,.checklist label{break-inside:avoid}.page-footer{margin-top:25px}.hero-description,.doc-section>p{color:#333}.checklist-hint{display:none}details:not([open]){display:none}a{text-decoration:none}}

diff --git a/index.html b/index.html
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..ca5aa7bbc504995e2b8a99402277be40ad8937f9
--- /dev/null
+++ b/index.html
@@ -0,0 +1,141 @@
+<!doctype html>
+<html lang="zh-CN">
+<head>
+  <meta charset="UTF-8">
+  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
+  <meta name="description" content="团队 Git 使用规范：统一分支命名、提交信息与代码评审流程，让每一次协作都有迹可循。">
+  <title>Git 使用规范 · 团队工程手册</title>
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="measure.css">
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
+</head>
+<body>
+  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">跳转到正文</a>
+  <aside class="sidebar" aria-label="文档导航">
+    <a class="brand" href="#overview" aria-label="团队工程手册首页"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><circle cx="7" cy="5" r="2"/><circle cx="17" cy="6" r="2"/><circle cx="7" cy="19" r="2"/><path d="M7 7v10m10-9v1a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H7"/></svg></span><span>团队工程手册<small>ENGINEERING HANDBOOK</small></span></a>
+    <div class="nav-label">协作与交付</div>
+    <div class="document-label"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 2.5h7l3 3v12H5z"/><path d="M11.5 2.5v4H15M7.5 10h5M7.5 13h5"/></svg>Git 使用规范<span class="live-dot"></span></div>
+    <nav class="section-nav">
+      <a class="active" href="#overview" aria-current="location"><span>00</span>概览</a>
+      <a href="#branches"><span>01</span>分支命名</a>
+      <a href="#commits"><span>02</span>提交信息</a>
+      <a href="#review"><span>03</span>代码评审</a>
+      <a href="#checklist"><span>04</span>合并检查清单</a>
+    </nav>
+    <div class="sidebar-note"><span class="note-icon" aria-hidden="true">↳</span><p>好的协作，<br>从一致的约定开始。</p><span>让变更清晰，让交付可靠。</span></div>
+    <div class="sidebar-footer"><span class="version">v1.0</span><span>团队协作约定</span><span class="footer-dot"></span></div>
+  </aside>
+  <div class="workspace">
+    <header class="topbar"><div class="breadcrumb">工程手册<span>/</span>协作规范<span>/</span><strong>Git</strong></div><button class="print-button" type="button" onclick="window.print()"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 7V2.5h10V7M5 14H3V7h14v7h-2M5 11h10v6H5z"/><path d="M14 9h1"/></svg>打印文档</button></header>
+    <div class="page-layout">
+      <main id="main">
+        <section class="hero" id="overview" aria-labelledby="page-title">
+          <div class="eyebrow"><span></span>团队协作规范 <span class="eyebrow-divider">/</span> WORKFLOW</div>
+          <h1 id="page-title">Git 使用规范<span class="title-dot">.</span></h1>
+          <p class="hero-description measure-prose">把约定写下来，把精力留给创造。<br>统一分支、提交与评审方式，让每一次变更都清晰、可追溯。</p>
+          <div class="meta"><span><span class="meta-icon" aria-hidden="true">◎</span>适用范围：团队所有代码仓库</span><span><span class="meta-icon" aria-hidden="true">◷</span>阅读约 6 分钟</span></div>
+          <div class="principle"><span class="principle-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><div><strong>一个任务，一个分支，一次有意义的合并。</strong><p>主分支始终保持可发布；所有变更通过 Pull Request（PR）评审后合入。</p></div></div>
+        </section>
+
+        <section class="doc-section" id="branches" aria-labelledby="branches-title">
+          <div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number">01</span><h2 id="branches-title">分支命名</h2><span class="heading-caption">BRANCH NAMING</span></div>
+          <p class="measure-prose">从最新的 <code>main</code> 创建工作分支，使用小写英文与连字符。名称应说明变更目的，并关联任务编号，方便检索与追踪。</p>
+          <div class="code-block syntax"><div><span class="code-label">命名格式</span><code><span class="code-accent">&lt;type&gt;</span>/&lt;issue-id&gt;-&lt;short-description&gt;</code></div><button class="copy-button" type="button" data-copy="feat/128-user-login" aria-label="复制分支命名示例">复制示例 <span aria-hidden="true">⧉</span></button></div>
+          <div class="table-wrap"><table><caption class="sr-only">分支类型、使用场景和命名示例</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">分支类型</th><th scope="col">使用场景</th><th scope="col">命名示例</th></tr></thead><tbody>
+            <tr><td><code class="type-pill">feat</code></td><td>新增功能</td><td><code>feat/128-user-login</code></td></tr>
+            <tr><td><code class="type-pill">fix</code></td><td>修复缺陷</td><td><code>fix/256-token-expiry</code></td></tr>
+            <tr><td><code class="type-pill">refactor</code></td><td>重构现有实现</td><td><code>refactor/312-auth-service</code></td></tr>
+            <tr><td><code class="type-pill">docs</code></td><td>更新文档</td><td><code>docs/108-api-guide</code></td></tr>
+            <tr><td><code class="type-pill">chore</code></td><td>构建、依赖与维护</td><td><code>chore/420-update-lint</code></td></tr>
+          </tbody></table></div>
+          <div class="inline-note"><span aria-hidden="true">ⓘ</span><p><strong>主分支保护</strong>：禁止直接推送或强制推送到 <code>main</code>。分支保持短期存活，合并完成后删除；没有任务编号时可省略编号。</p></div>
+          <details><summary>从一个干净的分支开始 <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><div class="detail-content"><p>确认工作区干净，再更新主分支并创建工作分支。</p><pre><code>git switch main
+git pull --ff-only origin main
+git switch -c feat/128-user-login</code></pre></div></details>
+        </section>
+
+        <section class="doc-section" id="commits" aria-labelledby="commits-title">
+          <div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number">02</span><h2 id="commits-title">提交信息</h2><span class="heading-caption">COMMIT MESSAGES</span></div>
+          <p class="measure-prose">一次提交只做一件事。使用统一的提交格式，让历史记录能直接回答“改了什么”，必要时在正文解释“为什么”。</p>
+          <div class="code-block syntax"><div><span class="code-label">提交格式 · scope 可选</span><code><span class="code-accent">&lt;type&gt;</span>(&lt;scope&gt;): &lt;description&gt;</code></div></div>
+          <div class="commit-example"><div class="example-header"><span><span class="example-dot"></span>一个清晰的提交</span><button type="button" class="copy-button" data-copy="feat(auth): 支持邮箱验证码登录&#10;&#10;为未设置密码的用户提供登录入口。&#10;新增验证码有效期与重试次数校验。&#10;&#10;Refs: #128">复制 <span aria-hidden="true">⧉</span></button></div><pre><code><span class="code-accent">feat</span>(auth): 支持邮箱验证码登录
+
+为未设置密码的用户提供登录入口。
+新增验证码有效期与重试次数校验。
+
+<span class="code-muted">Refs: #128</span></code></pre></div>
+          <div class="two-columns"><div><h3>写清楚变更</h3><ul class="plain-list"><li>类型沿用分支类型，测试使用 <code>test</code>，性能优化使用 <code>perf</code>。</li><li>描述以动作开头，如“修复”“新增”“移除”；标题建议控制在 72 字符内。</li><li>有不兼容变更时，在类型或作用域后加 <code>!</code>，并在正文说明迁移方式。</li></ul></div><div class="avoid-box"><h3><span aria-hidden="true">↘</span> 避免含糊的提交</h3><p><code>update</code><code>fix bug</code><code>修改一下</code></p><div class="avoid-divider"></div><p class="better-example">更好的写法</p><code>fix(auth): 修复令牌过期后无法退出的问题</code></div></div>
+        </section>
+
+        <section class="doc-section" id="review" aria-labelledby="review-title">
+          <div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number">03</span><h2 id="review-title">代码评审</h2><span class="heading-caption">CODE REVIEW</span></div>
+          <p class="measure-prose">作者对变更质量负责，评审者对合并质量把关。尽量让每个 PR 聚焦单一目标；大改动先拆分，或提前对齐设计。</p>
+          <ol class="workflow">
+            <li><span class="step-number">1</span><div><h3>先自查，再发起 PR <span class="role">作者</span></h3><p>检查差异，移除调试代码与敏感信息，运行相关测试。未准备好评审时，使用 Draft PR。</p></div></li>
+            <li><span class="step-number">2</span><div><h3>交代背景与验证方式 <span class="role">作者</span></h3><p>标题沿用提交格式；描述包含变更原因、主要改动、关联任务、测试结果与风险。界面变更附前后截图，必要时补充回滚方案。</p></div></li>
+            <li><span class="step-number">3</span><div><h3>邀请评审，逐项回应 <span class="role">作者 + 评审者</span></h3><p>至少邀请一位熟悉模块的同事，建议在一个工作日内首次响应。优先检查正确性、边界条件、可维护性与测试；明确区分必须修改的问题和可选建议。</p></div></li>
+            <li><span class="step-number">4</span><div><h3>通过检查后合并 <span class="role">合并负责人</span></h3><p>获得至少一位非作者的批准，所有必需 CI 检查通过，阻塞问题解决后，使用 Squash merge 合入。核对最终提交信息，删除工作分支。</p></div></li>
+          </ol>
+          <div class="review-note"><strong>评审后又有修改？</strong><p>推送修复后说明改动，并重新请求评审。新增实质性变更需要重新批准；发生冲突时，由作者解决并重新运行检查。</p></div>
+        </section>
+
+        <section class="doc-section" id="checklist" aria-labelledby="checklist-title">
+          <div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number">04</span><h2 id="checklist-title">合并前，再确认一次</h2></div>
+          <div class="checklist-header"><p>准备好把这次变更交给团队了吗？</p><output id="progress" aria-live="polite">0 / 5 已完成</output></div>
+          <div class="checklist">
+            <label><input type="checkbox"><span>分支命名和 PR 标题符合约定</span></label>
+            <label><input type="checkbox"><span>变更范围清晰，描述包含验证结果与关联任务</span></label>
+            <label><input type="checkbox"><span>相关测试与所有必需 CI 检查通过</span></label>
+            <label><input type="checkbox"><span>至少一位非作者批准，所有阻塞意见已解决</span></label>
+            <label><input type="checkbox"><span>最终提交信息准确，发布风险与回滚方式已明确</span></label>
+          </div>
+          <p class="checklist-hint">清单仅辅助本次自查，不替代仓库中的审批与自动检查。</p>
+        </section>
+        <footer class="page-footer"><span>让每一次提交，都成为可靠的协作记录。</span><a href="#overview">回到顶部 <span aria-hidden="true">↑</span></a></footer>
+      </main>
+      <aside class="page-toc" aria-label="本页目录"><div class="toc-title">本页内容</div><a href="#branches">分支命名</a><a href="#commits">提交信息</a><a href="#review">代码评审</a><a href="#checklist">合并检查清单</a><div class="toc-note"><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><strong>小步提交<br>及时评审<br>持续交付</strong><p>简单的约定，<br>长期的默契。</p></div></aside>
+    </div>
+  </div>
+  <div class="sr-only" id="copy-status" role="status"></div>
+  <script>
+    const copyStatus = document.getElementById('copy-status');
+    document.querySelectorAll('[data-copy]').forEach(button => {
+      button.addEventListener('click', async () => {
+        const value = button.dataset.copy;
+        try {
+          if (navigator.clipboard && window.isSecureContext) await navigator.clipboard.writeText(value);
+          else {
+            const field = document.createElement('textarea');
+            field.value = value; field.style.position = 'fixed'; field.style.opacity = '0';
+            document.body.appendChild(field); field.select();
+            const success = document.execCommand('copy'); field.remove(); button.focus();
+            if (!success) throw new Error('copy unavailable');
+          }
+          const original = button.innerHTML;
+          button.textContent = '已复制 ✓'; button.disabled = true;
+          copyStatus.textContent = '示例已复制到剪贴板';
+          setTimeout(() => { button.innerHTML = original; button.disabled = false; }, 1800);
+        } catch { copyStatus.textContent = '复制失败，请选中示例手动复制。'; button.textContent = '请手动复制'; }
+      });
+    });
+    const checks = [...document.querySelectorAll('.checklist input')];
+    checks.forEach(input => input.addEventListener('change', () => {
+      const count = checks.filter(item => item.checked).length;
+      document.getElementById('progress').textContent = `${count} / 5 已完成`;
+    }));
+    const links = [...document.querySelectorAll('.section-nav a')];
+    if ('IntersectionObserver' in window) {
+      const observer = new IntersectionObserver(entries => {
+        entries.forEach(entry => {
+          if (!entry.isIntersecting) return;
+          links.forEach(link => {
+            const active = link.hash === '#' + entry.target.id;
+            link.classList.toggle('active', active);
+            if (active) link.setAttribute('aria-current', 'location'); else link.removeAttribute('aria-current');
+          });
+        });
+      }, { rootMargin: '-10% 0px -65% 0px', threshold: 0 });
+      document.querySelectorAll('main section').forEach(section => observer.observe(section));
+    }
+  </script>
+</body>
+</html>
